  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>歡迎來到《Forever Stranded》</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你成功迫降在一顆星球上。四周除沙礫外幾乎一無所有。你必須遵循任務線，並在這嚴酷的環境中保持涼爽。謹防夜幕降臨，屆時恐將發生可怕之事&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你面臨的第一項挑戰是尋找水源以應對酷暑。</p>\n<p>第二項挑戰是取得食物以克服飢餓&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本地圖已設定為極限模式&nbsp;</p>\n<p>隨著進度推進，你將獲得更多生命數</p>\n<p>祝各位好運&nbsp;</p>\n<p>伺服器檔案請將範本重新命名為「world」（全部使用小寫）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fgwsheridan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LdrcVcj.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"289\" height=\"110\"></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fgwsheridan\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.akliz.net/gwsheridan</a>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我的推特：<strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/GWSheridan\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/GWSheridan</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請勿為了詢問伺服器位址或伺服器檔案而加入聊天室</p>\n<p>僅提供關於小錯誤的快速回覆&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若您使用 Tlauncher 或 Aternos，將「不會」獲得任何支援</p>\n<p>Discord 聊天室：<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/0rXhR3z16wHPEfbt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/0rXhR3z16wHPEfbt</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>沙漠地圖製作人 Jay_Jones：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/CorruptedHobo\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/CorruptedHobo</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GWSheridan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2NjDnGZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"292\" height=\"97\"></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GWSheridan\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/GWSheridan</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qqre-JFFO4c?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4vUG83YGLMY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>